<title>HONG KONG: W.I. Carr names head of research for India unit.</title>
<headline>W.I. Carr names head of research for India unit.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>W.I. Carr said on Monday it had appointed Mark Baughan as head of research of its Indian brokering subsidiary.</p>
<p>Baughan, based in Bombay, took over the position from Tony Duckworth, who became managing director of the Indian subsidiary, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>Baughan joined W.I. Carr from Union Bank of Switzerland where he was senior research analyst for India, it said.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
